  },
  {
   "id": "function:packages/fs/tool-fs/src/patch/execute.ts:commitPatch",
   "type": "function",
   "name": "commitPatch",
   "filePath": "packages/fs/tool-fs/src/patch/execute.ts",
   "lineRange": [
    40,
    121
   ],
   "summary": "按序提交已放行的计划：每操作先 stat 记录 before 基准再按 add/update/delete/move 分派 ctx.fs 变更（move 写目标+删源，目标已写源保留为已知半成效果）；FS_ABORTED 或版本未变校验失败的 I/O 错误标 unknown 并提示重读，其余标 failed 带 changes。",
   "tags": [
    "commit-loop",
    "move-semantics",
    "outcome-classification"
   ],
   "complexity": "complex"
  },
